{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"autoregressive-bottleneck","title":"自回归解码瓶颈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/foundations/autoregressive-bottleneck","wordCount":1397,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"draft-verify-paradigm","title":"草稿-验证范式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/foundations/draft-verify-paradigm","wordCount":1258,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"lossless-guarantee","title":"分布无损性保证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/foundations/lossless-guarantee","wordCount":1470,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础\">基础</h1><p>推测解码听起来像「让模型抢答」，但它能在生产环境立足，靠的不是直觉而是三个扎实的事实。本章把这三个事实逐一讲透，作为整个 hub 的地基。</p>\n<p>第一篇「自回归解码瓶颈」回答一个反直觉的问题：现代 GPU 每秒能做几百万亿次浮点运算，为什么生成一个 token 还要等几十毫秒？答案是解码阶段几乎不算数、全在搬权重——它是<strong>访存受限</strong>而非计算受限的。正是这块闲置的算力，给了推测解码可乘之机：并行验证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 和验证 1 个 token，耗时几乎一样。</p>\n<p>第二篇「草稿-验证范式」给出推测解码的骨架：一个便宜的草稿机制连猜 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token，目标模型把这 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个位置一次并行前向，然后从前往后逐位核对，接受到第一个不一致为止。理解这个循环，就理解了后面所有方法的共同框架——它们的差别只在「草稿从哪来」和「验证怎么做」。</p>\n<p>第三篇「分布无损性保证」处理最容易被误解的一点：推测解码<strong>不是</strong>近似、不是「为了快牺牲一点质量」。通过一个精心设计的拒绝采样准则与残差分布重采样，被接受的 token 序列在统计上与「老老实实用目标模型逐 token 采样」逐位同分布。无损是它能被默认开启的根本原因——你不必在质量和速度之间二选一。</p>\n<p>读完本章，你会明白推测解码<strong>为什么有用</strong>（瓶颈在访存）、<strong>骨架长什么样</strong>（草稿-验证循环）、以及<strong>为什么可以放心用</strong>（数学上无损）。这三点是阅读「草稿来源」「进阶」「实践」三章的共同前提。</p>\n"}